# Cursor rules

Follow the repository OKF policy. This file is a pointer; the canonical rules live in `doc/`.

- Start from `doc/README.md`, `doc/okf/agent-directives.md`, and `doc/status.md`.
- Follow `doc/standard/coding-practices-desktop-audio-recorder.md` for every code, script, and test change.
- Write all repository-facing text and code in American English.
- Recover state from AI Memory and `doc/status.md` at task start; record checkpoints in `doc/status.md`.
